label day1_plastic_metal_route:
    scene bg roadside
    show alu at center_slot
    with dissolve

    "You drag yourself across the gravel towards a flat slab of concrete near the curb where the orange soda-can had seated themselves. You find them leaning against a rock, their body tilted up towards the sun."

    alu "Ah! I see a member of the audience has made the exquisite decision to visit the backstage lounge! An amazing choice, Reese. I applaud you."

    r "Thanks... I guess. I just wanted to get to know you a little more if that's okay? You're pretty 'well known' I guess you could say."

    alu "Well known, you say? ...Yes, well known, well known! Indeed I am, my good Reese. I am simply destined for greatness! The manufacturing facilities! The consumer shelves! Unlike some of the... flimsier materials, metals like me are engineered for longevity!"

    r "Okay... at least tell me a little about yourself first."

    alu "Why, there is such a vast category of facts to select from! Why did you know that it can take as little as 2 months for aluminum to be recycled and reshelved? It is obvious why there is a great reason for my notability!"

    r "Oh okay..."

    alu "Ah, I must tell you Reese how pleasant it feels to be in the company of my devotees such as yourself. I do hope that I shall see you again Reese, if ever you wish to know more about my greatness."

    $ affinity_plastic_metal += 1

    return